## Phase 8 — Exit

```
[team-improve] homelab-company: experiment 20260408-163050 — keep — 4.96 → 5.00 — "Add time-sensitive approval nudge to OpsLead Phase 1d for >4h pending approvals on high/urgent/critical blocked issues"
```

**Summary:** One targeted change — added a "time-sensitive approval nudge" bullet to OpsLead's Phase 1d stale-blocked-issue check. When a blocked issue has high/urgent/critical priority (or a deadline in comments) and its pending approval has been waiting >4 hours, OpsLead now sends a Telegram nudge before waiting for the full 24h staleness threshold. This caught the real-world pattern where CEO recommends approval but the board doesn't act on time-critical issues. Only +23 words to OpsLead. The opslead-idle-agent-detection benchmark improved from 4.60 → 5.00, bringing the aggregate to a perfect 5.00.

